GET {{entsoeHost}}?securityToken={{token}}&documentType={{documentType}}&businessType={{businessType}}&contract_MarketAgreement.Type={{contractType}}&out_Domain={{domain}}&in_Domain={{domain}}&periodStart={{periodStart}}&periodEnd={{periodEnd}}
Accept: application/xml

### Our API
@spotPriceCalc_HostAddress = http://localhost:5262
@biddingZoneId = 6

### Populate ALL zones for today (writes to the DB) — run this first. Omit ?date to default to today (UTC).
POST {{spotPriceCalc_HostAddress}}/api/spotprices/populate
Accept: application/json

### Populate ALL zones for a specific date (e.g. tomorrow, after the day-ahead auction ~13:00 CET)
POST {{spotPriceCalc_HostAddress}}/api/spotprices/populate?date=2026-07-28
Accept: application/json

### Read stored prices for one zone for a single LOCAL delivery day (Slovakia = id 6)
GET {{spotPriceCalc_HostAddress}}/api/spotprices?biddingZoneId={{biddingZoneId}}&date=2026-07-20
Accept: application/json

